{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"fb445a7c58b5c355","type":"file","file":"算法学习/暴力解题方法与搜索问题/DFS + 正斜对角线.md","x":-240,"y":-1571,"width":1066,"height":627},
		{"id":"1b6e203d3850b422","type":"file","file":"算法学习/暴力解题方法与搜索问题/DFS + 回溯.md","x":-240,"y":-890,"width":1066,"height":640},
		{"id":"77b25635058278e3","type":"text","text":"```python\n# 最本质的代码片段\nfor i in range(n): \n    # 1. 剪枝判断：这一列、正对角线、反对角线是否都安全？\n    if not col[i] and not dg[u+i] and not udg[u-i+n]:\n        \n        # 2. 占领状态（置 1）：标记当前皇后对后续行的攻击范围\n        col[i] = dg[u+i] = udg[u-i+n] = 1 \n        \n        # 3. 递归探测：去放下一行的皇后\n        dfs(u + 1)\n        \n        # 4. 现场恢复（置 0）：回溯的核心，擦除标记，尝试当前行的下一个位置\n        col[i] = dg[u+i] = udg[u-i+n] = 0\n\n```","x":1060,"y":-1571,"width":920,"height":362},
		{"id":"6fb4c11ad864dbd2","type":"text","text":"\n# 关键的代码\n```python\nfor i in range(start, n + 1):\n    dfs(u + 1, i + 1)\n```","x":1117,"y":-670,"width":806,"height":200},
		{"id":"8d0e46d93fe3d5bf","type":"text","text":"DFS算法","x":-2060,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"86af2b49e866360c","type":"text","text":"组合与排列的穷举","x":-1120,"y":-890,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8c9f9d5a2824dec8","type":"text","text":"- **状态定义**：`state = (idx, a, b)`。这三个变量唯一确定了当前搜索的进度：我在哪（`idx`）？我手里还剩多少子弹（`a, b`）？\n- **记忆化套路**：\n```python\nif state in memo: return memo[state] # 查表，走过的路不再走\n...\nmemo[state] = res # 存表，为后面省时间\n```","x":1117,"y":800,"width":1371,"height":193},
		{"id":"f5b09bf1c0c9699b","type":"text","text":"**分支 B（加法变大）**：利用剩余的 $A$ 尽可能往上加，最高加到 $9$。\n- **代价**：$\\min(a, 9 - d)$ 次操作 $A$。\n- **核心代码**：`use_a = min(a, 9 - d); res = max(res, (d + use_a) * p10 + dfs(idx + 1, a - use_a, b))`","x":1117,"y":1320,"width":1238,"height":160},
		{"id":"dae9625de6fd7d8f","type":"text","text":"**分支 A（减法变 9）**：通过“向下减”跨越 $0$ 变成 $9$。\n- **代价**：$d + 1$ 次操作 $B$。\n- **核心代码**：`if b >= d + 1: res = max(res, 9 * p10 + dfs(idx + 1, a, b - (d + 1)))`","x":1117,"y":1120,"width":1238,"height":140},
		{"id":"08cddd74d61aab86","type":"text","text":"**权重的计算**\n$p10 = 10^{(length - 1 - idx)}$","x":1117,"y":1555,"width":540,"height":105},
		{"id":"cbc721fb94ef0101","type":"file","file":"算法学习/暴力解题方法与搜索问题/DFS + 状态压缩.md","x":-463,"y":760,"width":1357,"height":860},
		{"id":"44107f43bea84d44","type":"text","text":"有限资源约束下的状态空间搜索","x":-1520,"y":1150,"width":320,"height":80},
		{"id":"04bb9f0683893bd9","type":"file","file":"算法学习/暴力解题方法与搜索问题/DFS + 全排列.md","x":-240,"y":-40,"width":1066,"height":560},
		{"id":"4ba735b41bc6a82c","x":-463,"y":1760,"width":1357,"height":840,"type":"file","file":"算法学习/暴力解题方法与搜索问题/DFS 回溯 + 预处理约束映射.md"},
		{"id":"fcca594b22ea5b9a","x":1161,"y":1760,"width":1151,"height":179,"type":"text","text":"#### A. 坐标映射转换器\n```Python\nr, c = divmod(p, m) # 一维索引 p 瞬秒转为二维 (r, c)\n```"},
		{"id":"508ec74d1cd08617","x":1161,"y":2360,"width":1124,"height":178,"type":"text","text":"#### C. 局部求和校验\n```Python\n# 3x3 区域的切片求和逻辑\nfor i in range(max(0, tr - 1), min(n, tr + 2)):\n    for j in range(max(0, tc - 1), min(m, tc + 2)):\n        s += ans[i][j]\n```"},
		{"id":"900da0511011672e","x":1161,"y":2040,"width":1151,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"#### B. 封口时机预处理\n\n```Python\n# 核心：约束 (i, j) 的最后一块拼图是 (i+1, j+1)\nr_limit, c_limit = min(n - 1, i + 1), min(m - 1, j + 1)\ntodo[r_limit][c_limit].append((i, j))\n```"}
	],
